    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "understood. my worry is more about the risk of contamination if something goes wrong during the transition—like if a staff member isn't careful or if there's a breach in the cooling area. how do we best describe these \"hidden\" risks in the hazard analysis part of the plan to satisfy an inspector?",
